      "created_at": "2014-10-16T13:56:19.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Though I can't speak authoritatively, as I don't work for GTG ...</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I'm pretty sure GTG will make them available to distributors, so it's up to your FLGS to order them as to whether or not they show up in the store. After the initial print run, it will probably depend on how much demand there is as to whether or not GTG has more batches made.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
